## 5. Patent data analysis
## 5.1. Technical and statistical analysis
In a hybrid search strategy for finding related patents, two key terms, including the Metal organic framework and the Supercapacitor are combined with the ‘‘AND” logic. After reviewing the output of this search, a limitation on patents’ technology domain has been also applied in such a way that patents classified in related technology domains have been extracted for further studies. Since the next step, screening is done by human resources; the type of keyword definition is such that any patent in this domain can be found in the search list. 135 patents were found by applying this search strategy and the related patents (113) were separated at the screening stage (Fig. 26).
The main technical parameters used in patents’ searching strategy based on the project requirements are:
 Supercapacitor keywords:
Supercapacitor, Ultracapacitor, Supercap, Goldcap, Electrostatic double layer capacitor, EDLC, Electric double layer capacitor, Pseudo capacitor, Hybrid capacitor, High capacity capacitor, Pseudo capacitor EDLC, Pseudo EDLC, Power storage, Electro chemical capacitor, APowerCap, BestCap, BoostCap, CAP-XX, C-SECH, DLCAP, EneCapTen, EVerCAP, DynaCap, Faradcap, GreenCap, Goldcap, HY-CAP, Kapton capacitor, Supercapacitor, SuperCap, PAS Capacitor, PowerStor, PseudoCap, etc.
MOF keywords:
Metal organic framework, MOF, NMOF, MMOF, Porous MOF, Porous metal organic_frame_work, Diffrenet kinds of ZIF MOF, Diffrenet kinds of HKUST MOF, Diffrenet kinds of UIO MOF, MOF_1115, MOF_1130, MOF_1131, MIL_100, etc.
Relation of Technology Domain:
The relation of technical area is also considered by excluding patents classified in the following technical domains:
Machine tools, Telecommunications, Transport, Civil engineering, Food chemistry, control, Furniture, games, Other consumer goods, Optics, Handling, Engines, pumps, turbines, Audio-visual technology, Mechanical elements and Thermal processes and apparatus.
